00:28:27.580 --> 00:28:28.450
to present

00:28:28.450 --> 00:28:29.539
the candidates

00:28:29.539 --> 00:28:31.880
for honorary degrees.

00:28:31.880 --> 00:28:33.340
Mr. President,

00:28:33.340 --> 00:28:34.870
I have the honor

00:28:34.870 --> 00:28:39.060
to present the candidates for honorary degrees.

00:28:39.060 --> 00:28:43.080
For the degree of doctor of humanities,

00:28:43.080 --> 00:28:44.570
Robert Alter,

00:28:44.570 --> 00:28:51.570
scholar.

00:28:59.230 --> 00:29:02.610
As a scholar of comparative literature,

00:29:02.610 --> 00:29:05.600
your thoughtful and brilliant work

00:29:05.600 --> 00:29:06.739
ranges from

00:29:06.739 --> 00:29:09.370
studies of the English and European novel

00:29:09.370 --> 00:29:15.250
to questions of tradition and modernity to
trends in American and Jewish culture,

00:29:15.250 --> 00:29:20.590
but the greatest gifts you have given us are
your unparalleled translation and your interpretations

00:29:20.590 --> 00:29:22.420
of the Hebrew Bible.

00:29:22.420 --> 00:29:24.609
By combining a poetic ear 

00:29:24.609 --> 00:29:26.480
with intellectual rigor

00:29:26.480 --> 00:29:32.010
you have illuminating, illuminated been the meaning
of these ancient sacred texts in a fresh voice

00:29:32.010 --> 00:29:35.080
that is faithful to their origins.

00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:37.530
Celebrating the beauty and inspiration of
your work,

00:29:37.530 --> 00:29:39.399
we're pleased to convert the degree

00:29:39.399 --> 00:29:46.399
of doctor of humanities.

00:29:55.909 --> 00:30:00.140
For the degree of doctor of laws,

00:30:00.140 --> 00:30:03.710
Ellen Johnson Sirleaf,

00:30:03.710 --> 00:30:10.710
president of the Republic of Liberia.

00:30:29.420 --> 00:30:34.840
As an advocate for reform and as the first
woman elected as head of state in an African

00:30:34.840 --> 00:30:36.180
country,

00:30:45.350 --> 00:30:48.310
you are an inspiration.

00:30:48.310 --> 00:30:54.060
Arrested for challenging the ruling powers
you persevered to run for office, fight corruption,

00:30:54.060 --> 00:30:57.070
and bring integrity to government.

00:30:57.070 --> 00:31:00.350
Popular with your people and principled in
your politics,

00:31:00.350 --> 00:31:04.300
you have promoted economic development, improved
health,

00:31:04.300 --> 00:31:05.660
restored civility,

00:31:05.660 --> 00:31:07.310
and kept peace.

00:31:07.310 --> 00:31:11.370
Your vision of a renewed Liberia is becoming
a reality

00:31:11.370 --> 00:31:13.790
because of your sacrifice,

00:31:13.790 --> 00:31:15.100
dedication,

00:31:15.100 --> 00:31:15.909
determination,

00:31:15.909 --> 00:31:17.200
and wisdom.

00:31:17.200 --> 00:31:20.529
We are greatly honored to bestow upon you
the degree

00:31:20.529 --> 00:31:27.529
of doctor of law.

00:31:42.020 --> 00:31:46.860
For the degree of doctor of medical sciences,

00:31:46.860 --> 00:31:53.860
Michael Rutter, child psychiatrist.

00:32:00.200 --> 00:32:03.690
Widely acclaimed as the father of child psychiatry,

00:32:03.690 --> 00:32:05.000
your pioneering work

00:32:05.000 --> 00:32:09.400
has powerfully advanced our understanding of
the mental health,

00:32:09.400 --> 00:32:10.519
social development,

00:32:10.519 --> 00:32:13.760
and resilience of children and adolescents.

00:32:13.760 --> 00:32:17.880
Your seminal studies of the effects of disrupted
maternal interaction

00:32:17.880 --> 00:32:20.980
and the emotional mechanisms for coping with
stress

00:32:20.980 --> 00:32:24.690
have transformed the way we view child development.

00:32:24.690 --> 00:32:27.240
You've taken children seriously,

00:32:27.240 --> 00:32:31.950
examining behavior through the complex interaction
of environment,

00:32:31.950 --> 00:32:33.779
interpersonal relationships,

00:32:33.779 --> 00:32:36.620
genes, neuro-biology, and schooling.

00:32:36.620 --> 00:32:38.780
For your intellectual curiosity,

00:32:38.780 --> 00:32:41.930
your ground-breaking research, and your contributions

00:32:41.930 --> 00:32:44.159
to the well-being of children,

00:32:44.159 --> 00:32:45.769
we are proud to name you

00:32:45.769 --> 00:32:52.769
doctor of medical science.

00:33:03.630 --> 00:33:05.020
For the degree

00:33:05.020 --> 00:33:08.140
of doctor of humane letters,

00:33:08.140 --> 00:33:15.140
Michael Feinberg and David Levin, educators.

00:33:22.230 --> 00:33:24.749
You are educational entrepreneurs

00:33:24.749 --> 00:33:26.780
and visionaries.

00:33:26.780 --> 00:33:28.220
Your creation,

00:33:28.220 --> 00:33:30.820
the Knowledge is Power program,

00:33:30.820 --> 00:33:35.340
has helped poor children achieve impressive academic success.

00:33:35.340 --> 00:33:40.690
With more than eighty KIP schools now serving over 21, 000 students in

00:33:40.690 --> 00:33:41.750
nineteen states,

00:33:41.750 --> 00:33:45.260
you are showing how classrooms can be transformed

00:33:45.260 --> 00:33:47.850
and how the promise of public education

00:33:47.850 --> 00:33:49.790
can be fulfilled.

00:33:49.790 --> 00:33:51.210
You  practice

00:33:51.210 --> 00:33:53.140
what you teach _

00:33:53.140 --> 00:33:54.570
"Work hard,

00:33:54.570 --> 00:33:56.280
be nice."

00:33:56.280 --> 00:33:59.860
We are  pleased to award you, Michael, your first
Yale degree,

00:33:59.860 --> 00:34:03.299
and to welcome you home, David, for a second
one,

00:34:03.299 --> 00:34:10.299
doctor a humane letters.

00:34:21.919 --> 00:34:25.829
For the degree of doctor of fine arts,

00:34:25.829 --> 00:34:28.019
Zhang Yimou,

00:34:28.019 --> 00:34:35.019
filmmaker and choreographer.

00:34:40.779 --> 00:34:44.479
A genius with camera and choreography,

00:34:44.479 --> 00:34:45.339
your work

00:34:45.339 --> 00:34:49.999
has portrayed China in all its glory, complexity,

00:34:49.999 --> 00:34:51.859
contradiction, and charm.

00:34:51.859 --> 00:34:55.839
In films that explore triumph and oppression,

00:34:55.839 --> 00:34:58.069
history and hope,

00:34:58.069 --> 00:35:01.150
you have captured the struggles of the human
spirit

00:35:01.150 --> 00:35:03.870
and engaged and enlightened audiences

00:35:03.870 --> 00:35:05.519
around the globe.

00:35:05.519 --> 00:35:08.400
From film to opera to live performance,

00:35:08.400 --> 00:35:11.909
you're artistry amazes and entertains.

00:35:11.909 --> 00:35:15.799
The dazzling opening ceremony of the Beijing
Olympic games,

00:35:15.799 --> 00:35:18.789
you're epic salute to Chinese history and
culture,

00:35:18.789 --> 00:35:21.619
endures vividly in our memory.

00:35:21.619 --> 00:35:28.619
we are delighted to bestow on you this degree
of doctor of fine arts.

00:35:42.009 --> 00:35:46.299
For the degree of doctor of social sciences,

00:35:46.299 --> 00:35:47.650
Marilyn Strathern, 

00:35:47.650 --> 00:35:54.650
anthropologist.

00:35:58.079 --> 00:36:03.269
Your research has had a seminal influence
on the field of social anthropology.

00:36:03.269 --> 00:36:08.069
From your studies of gender in Melanesia
to your work on kinship in England, 

00:36:08.069 --> 00:36:13.039
you have made fundamental substantive and methodological advances.

00:36:13.039 --> 00:36:17.659
You are an intellectual's intellectual, admired
by your students,

00:36:17.659 --> 00:36:19.179
respected by your colleagues.

00:36:19.179 --> 00:36:22.519
You are a teacher of uncompromising standards

00:36:22.519 --> 00:36:27.729
and as the head of Girton college, an exemplary
citizen of Cambridge University.

00:36:27.729 --> 00:36:29.220
For your contributions,

00:36:29.220 --> 00:36:31.949
to our understanding of the human family,

00:36:31.949 --> 00:36:38.949
we name you doctor of social sciences.

00:36:48.799 --> 00:36:50.319
For the degree

00:36:50.319 --> 00:36:53.089
of doctor of letters,

00:36:53.089 --> 00:37:00.089
Orhan Pamuk, novelist.

00:37:05.219 --> 00:37:06.369
You have helped

00:37:06.369 --> 00:37:08.999
to give new life to the novel,

00:37:08.999 --> 00:37:11.430
one that weaves together past and present,

00:37:11.430 --> 00:37:13.689
modernity and history,

00:37:13.689 --> 00:37:16.059
national and cosmopolitan,

00:37:16.059 --> 00:37:17.819
secular and religious.

00:37:17.819 --> 00:37:20.929
Your stories are rich and multi-layered,

00:37:20.929 --> 00:37:23.339
complex and at times mystical.

00:37:23.339 --> 00:37:27.390
You're writing bridges the themes of east
and west,

00:37:27.390 --> 00:37:28.069
tackling

00:37:28.069 --> 00:37:30.489
issues and moral questions

00:37:30.489 --> 00:37:34.579
faced by thoughtful people in Turkey and
around the globe.

00:37:34.579 --> 00:37:37.939
The world has honored you with countless devoted readers.

00:37:37.939 --> 00:37:39.609
and a nobel prize.

00:37:39.609 --> 00:37:46.609
We add our acclaim with the degree of doctor of letters.

00:37:57.529 --> 00:38:01.799
For the degree of doctor of music.

00:38:01.799 --> 00:38:08.799
Aretha Franklin, vocalist.

00:38:28.979 --> 00:38:32.359
We know royalty when we see it

00:38:32.359 --> 00:38:34.219
and you are without question

00:38:34.219 --> 00:38:41.219
the queen of soul.

00:38:43.749 --> 00:38:45.749
A natural woman,

00:38:45.749 --> 00:38:48.459
you have been singing your whole life,

00:38:48.459 --> 00:38:52.239
learning the grace of gospel from family and faith community, 

00:38:52.239 --> 00:38:54.460
tuning it with your own

00:38:54.460 --> 00:38:57.259
sometimes painful, often joyful experience

00:38:57.259 --> 00:38:59.529
and creating a signature style
0:38:59.529,0:39:02.499.
that transcends any one musical genre

00:39:02.499 --> 00:39:06.279
You have some the nation's hopes at presidential
inaugurations

00:39:06.279 --> 00:39:07.799
and shared your gifts

00:39:07.799 --> 00:39:10.439
with generations of music lovers.

00:39:10.439 --> 00:39:12.099
From gospel to pop,

00:39:12.099 --> 00:39:13.799
from blues to hip-hop,

00:39:13.799 --> 00:39:17.049
your voice expresses our feelings.

00:39:17.049 --> 00:39:18.339
With the greatest

00:39:18.339 --> 00:39:21.960
R E S P E C T,

00:39:21.960 --> 00:39:28.960
we name you doctor of music.

00:39:47.989 --> 00:39:49.280
For the degree

00:39:49.280 --> 00:39:52.009
of doctor of science,

00:39:52.009 --> 00:39:59.009
Steven Chu, scientist and public servant.

00:40:06.979 --> 00:40:11.479
As an experimental physicist, you accomplished
the seemingly impossible

00:40:11.479 --> 00:40:15.069
but trapping and cooling atoms with beams
of light.

00:40:15.069 --> 00:40:15.969
Now

00:40:15.969 --> 00:40:17.689
you are confronting

00:40:17.689 --> 00:40:18.690
another

00:40:18.690 --> 00:40:20.390
formidable challenge,

00:40:20.390 --> 00:40:22.829
transforming national energy policy.

00:40:22.829 --> 00:40:27.209
You are promoting new technologies that will
reduce our dependence on foreign oil and even

00:40:27.209 --> 00:40:29.029
more significantly,

00:40:29.029 --> 00:40:30.130
overcome the dangers

00:40:30.130 --> 00:40:37.130
of global warming.

00:40:38.689 --> 00:40:42.279
As a community of scholars, we take immense
pride

00:40:42.279 --> 00:40:47.039
that a nobel laureate and physicist is serving
the nation at such a critical time

00:40:47.039 --> 00:40:48.730
and we're delighted to honor you

00:40:48.730 --> 00:40:55.730
with the degree of doctor of science.

00:43:33.949 --> 00:43:37.099
Let us pray. May the gracious one who has brought us to this joyous and glorious day

00:43:37.099 --> 00:43:40.769
guard us and guide us, as we

00:43:40.769 --> 00:43:42.859
go forth, inspiring us to turn our learning

00:43:42.859 --> 00:43:46.099
into lives dedicated to the service of

00:43:46.099 --> 00:43:48.469
truth and goodness,

00:43:49.519 --> 00:43:51.589
of light and peace,

00:43:51.589 --> 00:43:52.949
and of justice for all. Amen.

